{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近お肌の調子が良くなってきたかも生駒ちゃんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂になるまで肌荒れなんてなかったのに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ずっと悩みでしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと治ってきた(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長い道のりでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悩みがひとつ解消されそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/03/13/1406844/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の日曜日に開催されました、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サヨナラの意味ラストの個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お越しくださった皆様ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新規さん多いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部から5部まで初めましてがいっぱい言えてすごく嬉しかったです(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"就活生の方、受験終わってきました、\nこれから受験で来れません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節の変わり目、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様いろんな事が、挑戦がありますね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も毎日が挑戦。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に頑張りましょう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の握手会は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全ての部で髪型を変えました(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部は上に貼ってますストレートヘア"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部ハーフツインテール"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/03/13/1406844/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部ハーフツインテールくるくる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/03/13/1406844/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4部すずめちゃんヘア"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/03/13/1406844/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5部なんちゃっておだんご"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お洋服は念願のダブルチャカ トリガーワンピース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう体のラインにそったタイトなワンピースは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通にお店で試着してもいつも体に合わなくて、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダブルチャカのトリガーワンピース見たときに衝撃走りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このワンピースなら私もやっと着れる(´；ω；｀)☆☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私みたいな体型の女の子にぜひおすすめですよ(*´꒳`*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はラフォーレ原宿にお店出てるのでぜひ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイズフリーサイズもあるよっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子お揃いで着ましょ(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪型ひとつで雰囲気変わるものですね〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストレート派"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアアレンジ派"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見事に半分に分かれてました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様はどれがタイプですか？(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またインフルエンサーの握手会もよろしくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2017/03/13/1406844/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はるやまさんの新ＣＭに出演しております！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかとみさと！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"就活生の皆様ファイト(*´꒳`*)！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張る！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"就活してるみたいに色んなジャンルのお仕事やってみる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未来の自分の仕事の為に！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は秋田に行くよヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まなつよろぴくぴく〜(*´꒳`*)☆☆"}],"source":"archive"}